  "current-post-image-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5939891a020c_image%20(6).avif",
  "current-post-image-sizes": "100vw",
  "current-post-image-srcset": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5939891a020c_image%2520(6)-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5939891a020c_image%2520(6)-p-800.avif 800w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5939891a020c_image%20(6).avif 1916w",
  "company-logo-style": "background-image:url(\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc59f5ea1a022b_Alfi.avif\")",
  "title-post-2": "How Alfi increased its average basket by 28%.",
  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <figure style=\"padding-bottom:56.206088992974244%\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-video\">\n            <div>\n              <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VhyD1cMqGzY\" title=\"Innovorder x Alfi\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n          </figure>\n          <p>‍</p>\n          <p>Located on rue du Roi de Sicile, in the heart of the Marais in Paris, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/alfi.tradition/?hl=fr\">Alfi</a> is a star of social networks (+23K followers on Instagram). As a result, the queue often stretches on the sidewalk!</p>\n          <p>Albert Fitoussi, founder of Alfi, called on Innovorder to streamline his kitchen organization, serve his customers more quickly and increase his average basket.</p>\n          <h4><strong>80% of the orders go through its terminals</strong>.</h4>\n          <p>He started by installing 2 kiosks in his restaurant. By relieving his team of order taking and cashiering, he frees up a full time equivalent that he allocates to the preparation of sandwiches in the kitchen.</p>\n          <h4><strong>Its average basket goes from 18 to 23€, that is +28%!</strong></h4>\n          <p>Thanks to the <a href=\"/en/self-ordering-kiosk\">kiosks</a>, he is able to make more additional sales. In front of the screens, his customers enjoy themselves and often opt for an extra chiffonade, a drink or a dessert. We understand them, it's hard to resist temptation when faced with tempting photos!</p>\n          <h4><strong>His</strong>customers no longer queue up.</h4>\n          <p>In the kitchen, he sets up KDSs (or <a href=\"/en/kitchen-display-system\">production screens</a>). Since all orders arrive directly on the KDS, his assemblers save a lot of time during rushes. There is no need to sort tickets, and tickets are no longer lost. In the end, everything is simpler. By displaying the orders in color and in order of priority, he was able to optimize his organization.</p>\n          <blockquote><em>\"Innovorder is like our compass! Thanks to KDS, everything is fluid, the assemblers don't get it wrong. It's fun, intuitive and totally innovative.\"</em></blockquote>\n          <p>-</p>\n          <p>You are a restaurant owner and you are looking for a solution to simplify your life and to manage large volumes with complete peace of mind?</p>\n          <p>👉 <a href=\"/en/commercial-catering/independant\"><strong>Discover our expertise for fast food!</strong></a></p>\n        ",
  "right-head": "Alfi",
  "bozzolo-cat": "Independent",
  "div-html": "\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/self-ordering-kiosk\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5975dd1a0229_Borne%20de%20commande.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Self Ordering Kiosk</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/online-ordering-for-restaurant\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc59e0dd1a0228_Commande%20en%20ligne.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Online Ordering</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/point-of-sales-restaurant\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc596eea1a0225_Portefeuille-2.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Cash register</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/kitchen-display-system\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc595abf1a0222_%C3%A9cran%20de%20production.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Kitchen Display System</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                ",
